Division of Medical Image Computing, also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made to the original weights: the seven nnU-Net PyTorch checkpoints of the
"total" task were exported to ONNX (the fp32 models) and then quantized to 8-bit
integers with NNCF post-training quantization with accuracy control (the *_int8.onnx
models). The model cards (*.model_card.json) restate the nnU-Net configuration; the
label map restates TotalSegmentator's label numbers.

